  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rinderpest Biological Threat Reduction in the Post-eradication Era</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary outcome of the project will be to reduce the risk of rinderpest re-emergence by: 1) Decreasing the stocks of laboratory-held virus worldwide, and 2) Monitoring the existing virus holding facilities whilst simultaneously increasing ability of targeted countries to rapidly detect and re-eradicate the disease in the event of re-emergence by scaling up the global vaccine doses in existing RVRs.</narrative>
  </description>
